  "body": "What happens:\nRight-clicking a model or a tool in the browser tree does not show a Delete option in the context menu. The user must select the item and press the Delete key to remove it.\n\nExpected:\nThe context menu for models and tools includes a Delete entry that removes the selected item.\n\nEvidence:\nFound while using the browser tree. Delete works with the Delete key but not from the right-click menu.\n\nDone means:\nRight-clicking a model or a tool shows a Delete option in the context menu that deletes the item when clicked.",
